# Normalise line endings on checkout.
#
# Prettier enforces endOfLine: 'lf' (packages/config/prettier). Without this
# file, git checks out CRLF on Windows and `pnpm verify` fails locally on
# every file in the repo — while CI passes, because it checks out on Linux.
# A check that only fails on developer machines is worse than no check.
#
# Shell scripts must be LF regardless: scripts/*.sh runs in Linux containers.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# Generated; keep out of diffs.
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated
